        <mxCell id="_-I3z2eby6WCbaxVHvPk-20" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Initialise audio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;audio_init()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: Helvetica;&quot;&gt;1. Define local base bath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2. Define the test file path (WILL BE REMOVED LATER)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3. Configure the mute pins:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;3.1 Set AMP + DAC Mute pins to GPIO OUTPUT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;3.2 Mute amp (AMP MUTE GPIO HIGH)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;3.3 Mute DAC (DAC MUTE GPIO LOW)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;3.4 Signal pins configured (s_pins_configured = true)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4. Mute outputs (redundant?)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
